// spec: 7
// A straight segment a few degrees off horizontal or vertical, with the anchor that levels it.
diagram "near axis" size (500,300)
box users "Users" at (20,40) size (100,60)
box cdn "CDN" at (360,45) size (100,60)
box api "API" at (20,200) size (100,60)
line users_cdn users.right -> cdn.left end=arrow
line users_api users.bottom -> (74,200) end=arrow
